1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:02,927
♪

2
00:00:05,017 --> 00:00:06,597
( crowd murmuring )

3
00:00:11,437 --> 00:00:12,857
( Kirito sighs )

4
00:00:23,737 --> 00:00:24,577
Liena: KIRITO.

5
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:25,947
Kirito: EH?

6
00:00:25,947 --> 00:00:28,367
YEAH, LIENA?

7
00:00:28,367 --> 00:00:31,997
LISTEN. I HAVE FAITH
IN YOUR SKILLS AS A SWORDSMAN,

8
00:00:31,997 --> 00:00:34,287
BUT I HAVE TO WARN YOU
ABOUT SOMETHING.

9
00:00:34,287 --> 00:00:35,457
( Kirito sighs )

10
00:00:35,457 --> 00:00:37,627
Liena: THE LEVANTEINS
HAVE A SAYING

11
00:00:37,627 --> 00:00:39,337
HANDED DOWN FOR GENERATIONS.

12
00:00:41,007 --> 00:00:43,717
"SOAK YOUR SWORD
IN THE BLOOD OF THE MIGHTY,

13
00:00:43,717 --> 00:00:46,057
AND YOU WILL MAKE
THEIR STRENGTH BECOME YOUR OWN."

14
00:00:47,807 --> 00:00:49,807
Kirito: LIKE "BLOOD" BLOOD?

15
00:00:49,807 --> 00:00:52,097
Liena: YES.
BEFORE HE STARTED HERE,

16
00:00:52,097 --> 00:00:54,557
VOLO HAD BEEN ENGAGING
IN FIRST-STRIKE DUELS

17
00:00:54,557 --> 00:00:56,477
WITH REAL SWORDS FOR A WHILE.

18
00:00:56,477 --> 00:00:57,987
AS A RESULT OF THAT,

19
00:00:57,987 --> 00:01:00,567
THOSE EXPERIENCES ARE
WHAT GAVE HIM HIS POWER.

20
00:01:00,567 --> 00:01:01,657
( Kirito gasps )

21
00:01:01,657 --> 00:01:04,367
HIS IMAGINATION. OF COURSE!

22
00:01:04,367 --> 00:01:05,577
VOLO’S STRENGTH IS TIED

23
00:01:05,577 --> 00:01:08,327
TO AN OLD FAMILY MOTTO
HE GREW UP WITH,

24
00:01:08,327 --> 00:01:10,617
SO, IF HE BEATS SOMEONE STRONG,

25
00:01:10,617 --> 00:01:13,457
HE BELIEVES
HE’LL GET STRONGER FROM IT.

26
00:01:13,457 --> 00:01:15,957
Liena: WATCH OUT.
HE AIMS TO DRAW BLOOD TODAY

27
00:01:15,957 --> 00:01:18,707
SO HE CAN WET HIS BLADE
AND GROW EVEN STRONGER.

28
00:01:18,707 --> 00:01:19,797
( Kirito sighs )

29
00:01:20,917 --> 00:01:22,177
( gasps )

30
00:01:22,177 --> 00:01:24,137
Liena: I KNOW YOU CAN DO THIS.

31
00:01:24,137 --> 00:01:26,177
I HAVE THE UTMOST FAITH IN YOU.

32
00:01:26,177 --> 00:01:27,847
YOU ARE NOT
THE TYPE OF SWORDSMAN

33
00:01:27,847 --> 00:01:29,307
WHO WOULD FALL SO EASILY TO HIM.

34
00:01:30,847 --> 00:01:33,017
ALSO, THIS IS
THE PERFECT OPPORTUNITY

35
00:01:33,017 --> 00:01:35,017
TO FULFILL YOUR PROMISE.

36
00:01:35,017 --> 00:01:36,647
Kirito: WHAT PROMISE?

37
00:01:36,647 --> 00:01:38,527
OH! YEAH,

38
00:01:38,527 --> 00:01:40,897
I SAID I’D SHOW YOU
THE BEST SWORD SKILL I HAD.

39
00:01:40,897 --> 00:01:44,607
Liena: THAT’S RIGHT,
SO SHOW IT TO ME HERE ON HIM.

40
00:01:44,607 --> 00:01:46,117
Kirito: DONE.

41
00:01:46,117 --> 00:01:47,947
YOU’LL SEE THE BEST ONE I KNOW.

42
00:01:47,947 --> 00:01:49,907
( Liena chuckles )

43
00:01:49,907 --> 00:01:52,747
Volo: SHALL WE START,
TRAINEE KIRITO?

44
00:01:57,457 --> 00:01:58,627
YEAH.

45
00:02:00,837 --> 00:02:03,217
Volo: ELITE DISCIPLE SERLUT,

46
00:02:03,217 --> 00:02:05,007
WILL YOU SERVE
AS WITNESS TO THIS DUEL?

47
00:02:06,757 --> 00:02:08,307
Liena: YES, OF COURSE.

48
00:02:11,057 --> 00:02:14,347
ELITE DISCIPLE LEVANTEIN
VERSUS PRIMARY TRAINEE KIRITO.

49
00:02:14,347 --> 00:02:16,977
THE VICTOR SHALL BE THE ONE
WHO LANDS THE FIRST STRIKE.

50
00:02:16,977 --> 00:02:19,687
( crowd cheering )

51
00:02:19,687 --> 00:02:22,147
Liena: LET IT BE KNOWN
THAT BOTH PARTIES HAVE AGREED

52
00:02:22,147 --> 00:02:24,607
TO USE REAL SWORDS
IN THIS MATCH.

53
00:02:24,607 --> 00:02:26,237
( crowd murmuring )

54
00:02:34,037 --> 00:02:35,497
♪

55
00:02:35,497 --> 00:02:38,037
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

56
00:02:38,037 --> 00:02:39,667
( singing in Japanese )

57
00:02:50,807 --> 00:02:51,807
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

58
00:02:51,807 --> 00:02:53,637
( singing in Japanese )

59
00:03:09,907 --> 00:03:11,827
♪

60
00:04:20,127 --> 00:04:22,717
( crowd gasp )

61
00:04:24,967 --> 00:04:27,847
( crowd gasp )

62
00:04:27,847 --> 00:04:31,097
Humbert: OH, MY WORD! I DIDN’T
KNOW PAINTING SWORDS BLACK

63
00:04:31,097 --> 00:04:34,357
WAS A CUSTOM IN THE BOONIES.
DID YOU, LORD RAIOS?

64
00:04:34,357 --> 00:04:36,767
Raios: DON’T BE
SO INSENSITIVE, HUMBERT.

65
00:04:36,767 --> 00:04:38,727
IT’S NOT THE POOR PAGE’S FAULT

66
00:04:38,727 --> 00:04:40,817
HE’S TOO BUSY TO POLISH
THE FILTH FROM HIS SWORD.

67
00:04:40,817 --> 00:04:43,567
( crowd laughs )

68
00:04:43,567 --> 00:04:45,407
♪

69
00:04:51,997 --> 00:04:52,917
( Kirito gasps )

70
00:05:02,927 --> 00:05:06,797
Liena: MOUNTAIN-SPLITTING WAVE
OF THE HIGH-NORKIAN STYLE.

71
00:05:06,797 --> 00:05:08,757
HE’S STARTING
WITH HIS BEST SKILL! ( grunts )

72
00:05:11,767 --> 00:05:15,477
Kirito: THAT’S AVALANCHE,
A HEAVY, ONE-HIT THRUST...

73
00:05:15,477 --> 00:05:19,027
BUT IT’S
THE HARD-CORE VERSION OF IT.

74
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:21,817
HIS IMAGINATION’S
BOOSTING ITS POWER.

75
00:05:23,237 --> 00:05:25,737
DODGING’S NOT AN OPTION.

76
00:05:25,737 --> 00:05:29,157
NO. I’M GONNA
HAVE TO BLOCK HIS STRIKE.

77
00:05:29,157 --> 00:05:32,117
I GOT A PROMISE TO KEEP.

78
00:05:32,117 --> 00:05:35,287
I HAVE TO COUNTER
WITH SOMETHING BIGGER,

79
00:05:35,287 --> 00:05:37,587
LIKE THE FOUR-PART
VERTICAL SQUARE.

80
00:05:40,837 --> 00:05:43,837
( deep breath)

81
00:05:48,967 --> 00:05:50,307
( Volo yells )

82
00:05:54,597 --> 00:05:55,347
( Kirito grunts )

83
00:06:01,977 --> 00:06:04,447
( yells )

84
00:06:07,027 --> 00:06:08,157
Liena: HE BLOCKED IT!

85
00:06:08,157 --> 00:06:11,117
( Kirito grunting )

86
00:06:11,117 --> 00:06:13,447
( Volo grunting )

87
00:06:15,787 --> 00:06:18,127
Kirito: IF I CAN HOLD OUT...

88
00:06:18,127 --> 00:06:20,377
I CAN STILL GET
MY FOURTH HIT IN!

89
00:06:21,707 --> 00:06:22,417
( gasps )

90
00:06:25,717 --> 00:06:28,927
HOLY CRAP, IS THAT
THE SOURCE OF HIS POWER?!

91
00:06:28,927 --> 00:06:30,847
( all yelling )

92
00:06:35,347 --> 00:06:39,937
HE’S PICTURING HIS ANCESTORS
BACKING HIM UP!

93
00:06:39,937 --> 00:06:42,147
♪

94
00:06:42,147 --> 00:06:43,987
( Liena gasps )

95
00:06:45,317 --> 00:06:47,317
Kirito: I WON’T LOSE TO HIM.

96
00:06:47,317 --> 00:06:49,067
NO WAY!

97
00:06:51,907 --> 00:06:52,657
I CAN’T!

98
00:06:56,907 --> 00:06:59,917
I’M NOT GONNA LET YOU BEAT ME!

99
00:06:59,917 --> 00:07:01,587
♪

100
00:07:13,887 --> 00:07:17,057
Volo: D-DID HIS SWORD JUST GROW?

101
00:07:17,057 --> 00:07:17,727
( gasps )

102
00:07:22,357 --> 00:07:23,817
( gasps )

103
00:07:23,817 --> 00:07:25,397
( Kirito roaring )

104
00:07:34,367 --> 00:07:36,247
( yells )

105
00:07:46,377 --> 00:07:47,377
Azurica: THAT IS ENOUGH!

106
00:07:47,377 --> 00:07:49,047
( Kirito gasps )

107
00:07:50,127 --> 00:07:51,047
( Liena gasps )

108
00:07:55,137 --> 00:07:57,347
Kirito: M-MS. AZURICA.

109
00:07:57,347 --> 00:07:59,387
( footsteps )

110
00:07:59,387 --> 00:08:03,147
Volo: IF SHE DECIDES THE DUEL
IS OVER, WE MUST OBEY HER.

111
00:08:03,147 --> 00:08:06,027
Kirito: UM, OKAY.

112
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:07,317
BUT WHY, THOUGH?

113
00:08:07,317 --> 00:08:08,937
Volo: YEARS AGO,

114
00:08:08,937 --> 00:08:12,027
DURING THE FOUR EMPIRE
UNIFICATION TOURNAMENT,

115
00:08:12,027 --> 00:08:15,077
SHE WAS THE FIRST SWORDSMAN
TO REPRESENT NORTH NORLANGARTH.

116
00:08:15,077 --> 00:08:17,237
( Kirito gasps )

117
00:08:17,237 --> 00:08:21,367
Volo: TRAINEE KIRITO’S
PUNISHMENT IS HEREBY FULFILLED!

118
00:08:21,367 --> 00:08:24,287
NEXT TIME, TRY NOT
TO FLING MUD ONTO ANYONE.

119
00:08:24,287 --> 00:08:26,297
YOU WERE LUCKY TODAY.

120
00:08:26,297 --> 00:08:28,627
( Kirito gasps )

121
00:08:31,217 --> 00:08:33,547
( crowd cheering )

122
00:08:41,727 --> 00:08:43,437
( Eugeo laughs )

123
00:08:43,437 --> 00:08:45,307
( Kirito chuckles )

124
00:08:45,307 --> 00:08:46,687
( gasps )

125
00:08:47,977 --> 00:08:49,737
IT’S BACK TO NORMAL.

126
00:08:51,147 --> 00:08:53,487
( gasps )

127
00:08:54,987 --> 00:08:56,867
Liena: I THOUGHT
YOU’D BEEN SLASHED.

128
00:08:58,237 --> 00:08:59,247
Kirito: YEAH.

129
00:08:59,247 --> 00:09:00,957
TALK ABOUT CLOSE, HUH?

130
00:09:00,957 --> 00:09:03,247
Liena: ANYONE ELSE
WOULD HAVE SURRENDERED.

131
00:09:03,247 --> 00:09:06,787
OH, YOU HOPELESS FOOL.

132
00:09:06,787 --> 00:09:08,837
( sighs )

133
00:09:08,837 --> 00:09:11,837
THAT SAID,
IT WAS A MAGNIFICENT FIGHT.

134
00:09:11,837 --> 00:09:12,837
WELL DONE.

135
00:09:12,837 --> 00:09:16,217
I AM FOREVER GRATEFUL.

136
00:09:16,217 --> 00:09:20,097
ON THE ONE HAND,
I WISH I COULD’VE FOUGHT YOU,

137
00:09:20,097 --> 00:09:22,177
BUT ON THE OTHER,
YOU DID KEEP YOUR PROMISE

138
00:09:22,177 --> 00:09:24,307
AND SHOWED ME
WHAT YOU ARE CAPABLE OF.

139
00:09:24,307 --> 00:09:26,057
NICELY DONE.

140
00:09:26,057 --> 00:09:29,277
Kirito: BUT, UM, NOBODY WON.
IT WAS A DRAW.

141
00:09:29,277 --> 00:09:31,357
Liena: IS ACHIEVING A DRAW
AGAINST THE FIRST SEAT

142
00:09:31,357 --> 00:09:33,027
NOT GOOD ENOUGH FOR YOU?

143
00:09:33,027 --> 00:09:35,527
Kirito: UH, NO.
THAT’S NOT WHAT I MEANT.

144
00:09:35,527 --> 00:09:38,447
Liena: I HOPE NOT. THE RESULT
WASN’T EVEN THE POINT.

145
00:09:38,447 --> 00:09:40,117
SEEING YOU FIGHT WAS, ACTUALLY.

146
00:09:40,117 --> 00:09:42,037
IT TAUGHT ME SOMETHING,

147
00:09:42,037 --> 00:09:45,287
SOMETHING EXTREMELY IMPORTANT.

148
00:09:45,287 --> 00:09:49,037
WE CAN TALK ABOUT IT BACK
AT MY PLACE WHILE WE CELEBRATE.

149
00:09:49,037 --> 00:09:51,877
WE’LL INVITE EUGEO
AND LORD GOLGOROSSO, TOO.

150
00:09:51,877 --> 00:09:53,087
( Kirito chuckles )

151
00:09:53,087 --> 00:09:54,337
SURE!

152
00:09:54,337 --> 00:09:56,297
( crowd cheering )

153
00:09:56,297 --> 00:09:58,047
( Raios growls )

154
00:10:03,847 --> 00:10:05,517
Azurica: HMM.

155
00:10:05,517 --> 00:10:07,187
- ( no audible dialogue )
- ( cheering fades )

156
00:10:10,317 --> 00:10:13,647
Liena: AS I WAS WATCHING
YOUR MATCH, IT HIT ME AGAIN.

157
00:10:13,647 --> 00:10:17,317
YOUR AINCRAD STYLE
HAS LIMITLESS POSSIBILITIES.

158
00:10:17,317 --> 00:10:20,907
AS FOR THE SERLUT STYLE, I ONCE
SAW IT AS A PRACTICAL SKILL,

159
00:10:20,907 --> 00:10:22,287
BUT IT’S TOO STIFF.

160
00:10:22,287 --> 00:10:24,327
Kirito: OH, COME ON.
DON’T GO THERE AGAIN.

161
00:10:24,327 --> 00:10:28,127
I HAVEN’T BEATEN YOU
A SINGLE TIME SINCE I GOT HERE.

162
00:10:28,127 --> 00:10:30,497
SERLUT STYLE’S ATTACKS
ARE SO DIVERSE.

163
00:10:30,497 --> 00:10:32,957
IN MY BOOK,
THAT’S WHAT MAKES IT SO AMAZING.

164
00:10:34,297 --> 00:10:36,257
( Liena sighs )

165
00:10:36,257 --> 00:10:38,257
ITS HISTORY IS, TOO.

166
00:10:38,257 --> 00:10:40,007
Kirito: HOW?

167
00:10:40,007 --> 00:10:42,177
Liena: ONCE,
A DISTANT ANCESTOR OF MINE

168
00:10:42,177 --> 00:10:45,097
ANGERED THE EMPEROR AT THE TIME,
AND, BECAUSE OF THAT,

169
00:10:45,097 --> 00:10:46,807
THE SERLUT FAMILY WAS BANISHED

170
00:10:46,807 --> 00:10:50,057
FROM THE OFFICIAL
HIGH NORKIA STYLE INDEFINITELY.

171
00:10:50,057 --> 00:10:51,567
( Kirito gasps )

172
00:10:51,567 --> 00:10:54,817
Liena: SO MY FAMILY IMPROVISED,
AND THEN, FROM THAT,

173
00:10:54,817 --> 00:10:57,487
OUR NONTRADITIONAL STYLE
WAS DEVELOPED,

174
00:10:57,487 --> 00:10:59,487
BECOMING THE SERLUT STYLE.

175
00:10:59,487 --> 00:11:01,777
I DON’T RESENT IT BY ANY MEANS.

176
00:11:01,777 --> 00:11:05,327
ON THE CONTRARY, I HAVE ALWAYS
BEEN PROUD OF OUR STYLE.

177
00:11:05,327 --> 00:11:08,287
( sighs ) STILL...

178
00:11:08,287 --> 00:11:10,997
I MAY HAVE RETAINED SOME DOUBTS
ABOUT ITS LEGITIMACY.

179
00:11:10,997 --> 00:11:12,457
( Kirito gasps )

180
00:11:12,457 --> 00:11:15,087
Liena: THESE TWO YEARS,
I COULDN’T BEAT VOLO,

181
00:11:15,087 --> 00:11:17,717
NOT BECAUSE HE SPECIALIZED
IN A BETTER STYLE,

182
00:11:17,717 --> 00:11:20,337
BUT BECAUSE
I FELT MINE WAS LESSER.

183
00:11:20,337 --> 00:11:22,007
Kirito: LIENA.

184
00:11:22,007 --> 00:11:23,887
Liena: YOU AND I, THOUGH,

185
00:11:23,887 --> 00:11:26,677
WE BOTH HAVE
UNIQUE STYLES OF SWORDPLAY.

186
00:11:26,677 --> 00:11:29,017
THE DIFFERENCE IS
YOU DON’T FEEL INFERIOR

187
00:11:29,017 --> 00:11:31,807
TO THOSE TRAINED
IN MORE ORTHODOX STYLES.

188
00:11:33,227 --> 00:11:36,277
AFTER WATCHING YOU
THIS PAST YEAR

189
00:11:36,277 --> 00:11:39,147
AND SEEING HOW YOU FOUGHT
WITH VOLO IN TODAY’S DUEL,

190
00:11:39,147 --> 00:11:42,197
TO BE HONEST, I THINK
I UNDERSTAND WHY YOU DON’T.

191
00:11:42,197 --> 00:11:45,237
FOR ME,
KNOWING I’M THE SUCCESSOR

192
00:11:45,237 --> 00:11:49,497
TO THE SERLUT STYLE FILLS ME
WITH GREAT PRIDE AND JOY.

193
00:11:49,497 --> 00:11:51,167
THERE IS NO BETTER FEELING.

194
00:11:51,167 --> 00:11:54,877
BECOMING YOUR MENTOR
IS A CLOSE SECOND, THOUGH.

195
00:11:54,877 --> 00:11:57,047
( Kirito chuckles )
THANKS, LIENA.

196
00:11:57,047 --> 00:11:59,837
AND NOW THAT YOU SAW
HOW I COUNTERED VOLO,

197
00:11:59,837 --> 00:12:02,467
YOU SHOULDN’T HAVE ANY TROUBLE
BEATING HIM IN THE FINALS.

198
00:12:02,467 --> 00:12:04,007
Liena: RIGHT.

199
00:12:04,007 --> 00:12:06,557
♪

200
00:12:22,067 --> 00:12:22,737
( Kirito gasps )

201
00:12:24,327 --> 00:12:26,117
Raios: OH. WELL, WELL!

202
00:12:26,117 --> 00:12:27,447
WHAT PERFECT TIMING!

203
00:12:27,447 --> 00:12:30,407
I WAS HOPING I’D RUN INTO YOU,

204
00:12:30,407 --> 00:12:32,287
AND HERE YOU ARE.

205
00:12:32,287 --> 00:12:33,417
Kirito: WHAT DO YOU GUYS WANT?

206
00:12:35,497 --> 00:12:37,957
Raios: WELL, NATURALLY
I WANTED TO COMMEND YOU

207
00:12:37,957 --> 00:12:40,467
ON YOUR DAZZLING
PERFORMANCE EARLIER.

208
00:12:40,467 --> 00:12:43,677
Humbert: TRUE. THOSE WERE
SOME VERY FLASHY-LOOKING SKILLS.

209
00:12:43,677 --> 00:12:46,717
I’M CERTAIN YOU UNNERVED
FIRST SEAT LEVANTEIN

210
00:12:46,717 --> 00:12:48,307
WITH YOUR DASHING THEATRICS.

211
00:12:48,307 --> 00:12:50,517
( both laugh )

212
00:12:50,517 --> 00:12:52,347
Kirito: WHAT ARE YOU,
PICKIN’ A FIGHT?

213
00:12:52,347 --> 00:12:55,187
Raios: CERTAINLY NOT!
A NOBLEMAN WOULD NEVER DARE

214
00:12:55,187 --> 00:12:58,147
ENGAGE IN UNCOUTH ACTIVITIES
WITH A COMMONER,

215
00:12:58,147 --> 00:13:00,277
UNLESS IT’S GIVING HANDOUTS.

216
00:13:00,277 --> 00:13:02,857
( both laugh )

217
00:13:05,567 --> 00:13:07,237
Raios: TO PRAISE YOUR STUNT--

218
00:13:07,237 --> 00:13:10,407
NO, TO HONOR YOUR BATTLE,
HERE IS A GIFT.

219
00:13:10,407 --> 00:13:11,867
NO NEED TO THANK ME.

220
00:13:11,867 --> 00:13:15,207
IT IS MY ONE CHARITABLE ACT
FOR THE DAY.

221
00:13:15,207 --> 00:13:17,417
GOOD NIGHT, SIR KIRITO.

222
00:13:17,417 --> 00:13:19,167
Humbert: "SIR" NOTHING!

223
00:13:19,167 --> 00:13:21,087
♪

224
00:13:24,547 --> 00:13:25,467
( Kirito gasps )

225
00:13:27,507 --> 00:13:29,427
( gasping )

226
00:13:49,447 --> 00:13:51,947
Kirito: IT STARTED OUT
AS AN EXPERIMENT.

227
00:13:54,997 --> 00:13:57,327
THE ZEPHILIA IS A TYPE OF FLOWER

228
00:13:57,327 --> 00:14:00,127
THAT DOESN’T BLOOM
ANYWHERE IN THE NORTHERN EMPIRE.

229
00:14:00,127 --> 00:14:02,877
LIENA TOLD ME
THAT THEY WERE HER FAVORITE.

230
00:14:02,877 --> 00:14:07,177
I TRIED TO MAKE ’EM BLOOM
USING MY IMAGINATION THEORY.

231
00:14:08,507 --> 00:14:10,137
AND ALONG THE WAY

232
00:14:10,137 --> 00:14:13,267
I STARTED IDENTIFYING
WITH THE FLOWERS,

233
00:14:13,267 --> 00:14:15,557
’CAUSE I KNEW HOW HARD IT WAS,

234
00:14:15,557 --> 00:14:18,057
TRYING TO STAY ALIVE
IN A FOREIGN PLACE.

235
00:14:19,977 --> 00:14:22,107
HAVING BEEN CUT OFF
FROM THE REAL WORLD

236
00:14:22,107 --> 00:14:24,777
AND ALL THE PEOPLE
I LOVED AND CARED FOR

237
00:14:24,777 --> 00:14:28,567
MADE ME FEEL MORE AND MORE ALONE
AS TIME WENT ON HERE.

238
00:14:28,567 --> 00:14:31,237
I SHARED THAT PAIN
WITH THESE FLOWERS.

239
00:14:31,237 --> 00:14:33,157
♪

240
00:14:36,367 --> 00:14:37,497
I’M SORRY.

241
00:14:45,587 --> 00:14:47,127
( Kirito gasps )

242
00:14:51,467 --> 00:14:53,387
( crying )

243
00:14:57,847 --> 00:14:59,397
- Woman: HAVE FAITH.
- ( Kirito gasps )

244
00:15:00,767 --> 00:15:02,147
Woman: BELIEVE IN THE STRENGTH

245
00:15:02,147 --> 00:15:04,647
OF THE FLOWERS
YOU GREW IN THIS FOREIGN SOIL.

246
00:15:04,647 --> 00:15:06,237
Kirito: WHO’S THERE?

247
00:15:06,237 --> 00:15:08,607
Woman: BELIEVE IN YOURSELF, TOO,

248
00:15:08,607 --> 00:15:11,327
FOR HELPING THEM GROW
AS WELL AS THEY HAVE.

249
00:15:13,737 --> 00:15:17,457
Kirito: YEAH, BUT IT
DIDN’T MATTER IN THE END.

250
00:15:17,457 --> 00:15:19,577
Woman: WORRY NOT.

251
00:15:19,577 --> 00:15:22,667
THEIR ROOTS STILL CLING TO LIFE
WITHIN THE SOIL.

252
00:15:22,667 --> 00:15:26,337
YOU SENSE IT, DO YOU NOT?

253
00:15:26,337 --> 00:15:28,337
THE SACRED FLOWERS
IN THIS GARDEN

254
00:15:28,337 --> 00:15:30,427
WANT TO SAVE THEIR FRIENDS.

255
00:15:30,427 --> 00:15:32,597
THEIR ENERGY SHALL AID YOU.

256
00:15:35,137 --> 00:15:37,017
Kirito: BUT HOW?

257
00:15:37,017 --> 00:15:39,937
I DON’T KNOW
ANY OF THE SPELLS THAT CAN HELP.

258
00:15:39,937 --> 00:15:43,897
YOU DO NOT NEED TO.
THE ARTS ARE ONLY TOOLS

259
00:15:43,897 --> 00:15:46,397
TO HARNESS
AND REFINE THE MEANING,

260
00:15:46,397 --> 00:15:48,647
OR WHAT YOU CALL
THE "MENTAL IMAGE."

261
00:15:48,647 --> 00:15:51,567
USE YOUR HEART.

262
00:15:51,567 --> 00:15:55,487
FEEL THE PRAYERS OF THE FLOWERS,
THE WAYS OF THE WORLD.

263
00:15:57,077 --> 00:15:59,617
Kirito: FEEL THE PRAYERS
OF THE FLOWERS,

264
00:15:59,617 --> 00:16:01,577
THE MEANING.

265
00:16:01,577 --> 00:16:03,497
( breathing deeply )

266
00:16:11,637 --> 00:16:12,927
( gasps )

267
00:16:14,467 --> 00:16:16,137
♪

268
00:16:27,727 --> 00:16:30,647
PLEASE, HELP ME.

269
00:16:30,647 --> 00:16:33,617
I NEED YOU TO SHARE
SOME OF YOUR POWER.

270
00:16:33,617 --> 00:16:38,497
IMAGINE THE FLOWERS’S LIFE FORCE
FLOWING THROUGH YOU

271
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:41,367
AND INTO THE ZEPHILIAS’S ROOTS.

272
00:16:41,367 --> 00:16:43,037
♪

273
00:17:06,227 --> 00:17:08,147
( gasps )

274
00:17:12,607 --> 00:17:14,317
WHOEVER YOU ARE...

275
00:17:18,737 --> 00:17:20,197
THANKS A LOT.

276
00:17:21,707 --> 00:17:23,367
( crowd cheering )

277
00:17:28,297 --> 00:17:29,757
( Liena yells )

278
00:17:29,757 --> 00:17:31,167
( Volo yells )

279
00:17:32,417 --> 00:17:34,257
♪

280
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:37,297
( wooden blades clacking )

281
00:17:58,987 --> 00:17:59,907
( Liena gasps )

282
00:18:20,347 --> 00:18:21,347
( grunts )

283
00:18:21,347 --> 00:18:23,307
( Volo yells )

284
00:18:24,727 --> 00:18:27,347
( Liena yells )

285
00:18:32,357 --> 00:18:34,437
( yells )

286
00:18:42,617 --> 00:18:44,077
( Volo gasps )

287
00:18:47,417 --> 00:18:48,917
Azurica: MATCH OVER!

288
00:18:48,917 --> 00:18:50,497
( crowd cheering )

289
00:18:52,337 --> 00:18:54,257
( Eugeo laughs )

290
00:19:00,427 --> 00:19:02,097
♪

291
00:19:06,847 --> 00:19:08,517
( no audible dialogue )

292
00:19:08,517 --> 00:19:09,857
Kirito: LIENA GRADUATED

293
00:19:09,857 --> 00:19:12,397
FROM THE NORTH CENTORIA
SWORDCRAFT ACADEMY.

294
00:19:13,727 --> 00:19:15,277
( chuckles )

295
00:19:15,277 --> 00:19:17,737
SHE WAS THE TOP-RANKED
STUDENT THAT YEAR.

296
00:19:17,737 --> 00:19:19,237
( Liena laughs )

297
00:19:19,237 --> 00:19:22,117
Kirito: AFTER
OUR ADVANCEMENT EXAM,

298
00:19:22,117 --> 00:19:25,497
EUGEO AND ME WERE RANKED
SEAT FIVE AND SIX

299
00:19:25,497 --> 00:19:27,827
AND GOT PROMOTED
TO ELITE DISCIPLES.

300
00:19:30,377 --> 00:19:33,667
Girl: ELITE DISCIPLE EUGEO,
I AM HERE TO REPORT.

301
00:19:33,667 --> 00:19:37,127
THE ASSIGNED CLEANING
HAS BEEN COMPLETED!

302
00:19:37,127 --> 00:19:39,177
THANKS, TIESE. GOOD WORK.

303
00:19:39,177 --> 00:19:40,717
I DON’T HAVE
ANYTHING ELSE FOR YOU,

304
00:19:40,717 --> 00:19:41,467
SO YOU’RE FREE TO GO.

305
00:19:42,887 --> 00:19:44,427
OH, AND, UM...

306
00:19:46,517 --> 00:19:47,767
( girl whimpers )

307
00:19:47,767 --> 00:19:50,097
( Eugeo chuckles )
I’M SORRY, RONIE.

308
00:19:50,097 --> 00:19:52,607
I DON’T KNOW HOW MANY TIMES
I’VE TOLD HIM TO BE BACK

309
00:19:52,607 --> 00:19:55,357
BEFORE YOU FINISH CLEANING,
BUT HE NEVER LISTENS.

310
00:19:55,357 --> 00:19:57,937
Ronie: IT’S FINE! I-I’LL JUST
WAIT UNTIL HE COMES BACK

311
00:19:57,937 --> 00:19:59,607
SO I CAN MAKE MY REPORT.

312
00:19:59,607 --> 00:20:01,107
Eugeo: YOU KNOW,
IF YOU REALLY WANT,

313
00:20:01,107 --> 00:20:03,277
I CAN ALWAYS PUT IN A GOOD WORD

314
00:20:03,277 --> 00:20:05,787
SO YOU CAN GET YOUR MENTOR
CHANGED TO SOMEONE ELSE.

315
00:20:05,787 --> 00:20:07,827
YOU’RE GOING TO HAVE
A REALLY LONG YEAR

316
00:20:07,827 --> 00:20:10,207
IF YOU SERVE UNDER HIM.
JUST A WARNING.

317
00:20:10,207 --> 00:20:11,787
Ronie: OH, I-I DON’T MIND!

318
00:20:11,787 --> 00:20:13,337
- Kirito: I KNEW IT!
- ( both gasp )

319
00:20:13,337 --> 00:20:16,957
Kirito: YOU GUYS WERE TALKING
ABOUT ME BEHIND MY BACK.

320
00:20:16,957 --> 00:20:18,667
( Ronie gasps )

321
00:20:18,667 --> 00:20:21,797
UM, ELITE DISCIPLE KIRITO,
HERE’S MY REPORT.

322
00:20:21,797 --> 00:20:23,257
CLEANING IS COMPLETE.

323
00:20:23,257 --> 00:20:25,057
EVERYTHING IS SHINY
AND SPOTLESS.

324
00:20:25,057 --> 00:20:26,847
Kirito: OH, OKAY. THANKS.

325
00:20:26,847 --> 00:20:28,347
Eugeo: COME ON, KIRITO.

326
00:20:28,347 --> 00:20:30,057
THESE TWO HAVE
A LOT ON THEIR PLATE,

327
00:20:30,057 --> 00:20:32,057
SO PLEASE RESPECT THAT.

328
00:20:32,057 --> 00:20:34,767
AT LEAST TRY TO GET BACK HERE
BEFORE THEY’RE DONE CLEANING.

329
00:20:34,767 --> 00:20:36,817
AND COULD YOU TELL ME
WHY YOU’RE COMING IN

330
00:20:36,817 --> 00:20:38,357
THROUGH THE WINDOW
ALL OF A SUDDEN?

331
00:20:38,357 --> 00:20:39,647
Kirito: ’CAUSE IT’S
THE SHORTEST ROUTE

332
00:20:39,647 --> 00:20:41,107
FROM EAST THIRD STREET.

333
00:20:41,107 --> 00:20:43,407
IT’S WAY FASTER
THAN GOING THROUGH THE LOBBY.

334
00:20:43,407 --> 00:20:45,327
KEEP THAT IN MIND,
’CAUSE ON DAYS

335
00:20:45,327 --> 00:20:46,907
YOU’RE RUNNING LATE,
IT’S A LIFESAVER.

336
00:20:46,907 --> 00:20:48,197
Girls: OH! RIGHT!

337
00:20:48,197 --> 00:20:51,497
Eugeo: COULD YOU
NOT TEACH THEM THAT?

338
00:20:51,497 --> 00:20:53,497
HANG ON. IF YOU’RE
COMING FROM EAST THIRD,

339
00:20:53,497 --> 00:20:54,707
THEN THAT BAG IS FROM--

340
00:20:54,707 --> 00:20:57,127
Kirito: HA! SO MUCH FOR MANNERS

341
00:20:57,127 --> 00:20:59,667
WHEN YOUR STOMACH’S RUMBLING,
EH, EUGEO?

342
00:21:00,757 --> 00:21:02,127
HERE.

343
00:21:02,127 --> 00:21:03,467
( girls gasp )

344
00:21:06,047 --> 00:21:07,967
Kirito: HERE. I BOUGHT EXTRA

345
00:21:07,967 --> 00:21:10,097
SO YOU CAN SHARE SOME
WITH YOUR DORMMATES.

346
00:21:10,097 --> 00:21:12,727
( girls laugh )

347
00:21:12,727 --> 00:21:15,977
Ronie: THANK YOU SO MUCH,
ELITE DISCIPLE KIRITO!

348
00:21:15,977 --> 00:21:17,937
Tiese: WE’LL HEAD BACK
AS FAST AS WE CAN

349
00:21:17,937 --> 00:21:20,147
AND EAT THESE
BEFORE THEIR LIFE DECREASES!

350
00:21:20,147 --> 00:21:21,027
WE’LL SEE YOU TOMORROW!

351
00:21:23,357 --> 00:21:27,027
OOH! IT’S FULL OF HONEY PIES
FROM THE PRANCING DEER CAFÉ!

352
00:21:27,027 --> 00:21:28,657
LET’S HURRY
BEFORE THEY GET COLD!

353
00:21:28,657 --> 00:21:30,037
- Ronie: YEAH!
- Tiese: COME ON!

354
00:21:30,037 --> 00:21:31,037
( Eugeo sighs )

355
00:21:31,037 --> 00:21:32,997
( Kirito swallows )

356
00:21:32,997 --> 00:21:34,497
WHAT’S UP?

357
00:21:34,497 --> 00:21:37,457
Eugeo: OH, NOTHING MUCH, REALLY.

358
00:21:37,457 --> 00:21:40,457
IT’S JUST I’M WONDERING
WHERE YOUR HEAD’S AT.

359
00:21:40,457 --> 00:21:42,967
I HOPE YOU HAVEN’T GOTTEN
SO COMFORTABLE LATELY

360
00:21:42,967 --> 00:21:45,427
THAT YOU’VE FORGOTTEN WHY WE
CAME HERE IN THE FIRST PLACE.

361
00:21:45,427 --> 00:21:47,797
( Kirito chuckles )
LIKE I’D FORGET.

362
00:21:47,797 --> 00:21:48,557
( swallows )

363
00:21:49,927 --> 00:21:52,057
WE’RE CLOSER NOW THAN EVER.

364
00:21:56,557 --> 00:21:57,477
Eugeo: MM-HMM.

365
00:21:59,897 --> 00:22:01,487
ALMOST THERE.

366
00:22:05,027 --> 00:22:06,027
♪

367
00:22:06,027 --> 00:22:07,947
( singing in Japanese )

368
00:22:42,277 --> 00:22:46,107
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪

